WEBVTT

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.440
It's the Saints! They're so cool!

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.480
That's footage from their legendary final concert three years ago.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.870
Really?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.120
You know everything, Non!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.120
Man, their dancing is great
and those clothes are adorable!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.450
Lala!

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.160
Quit making a ruckus right after
waking up and eat your breakfast!

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.020
It's not my fault I inherited your loud voice!

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.870
Who are you calling loud?!

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.730
You're way louder than me!

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.220
You're the loud one.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:34.830
You're like a loudspeaker or a firetruck or a siren!
You're the loud one.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.380
You're like a loudspeaker or a firetruck or a siren!

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.540
Stop arguing and eat.
You're like a loudspeaker or a firetruck or a siren!

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:37.570
You're like a loudspeaker or a firetruck or a siren!

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.090
Huh? Where's Non?

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:42.530
She finished eating and left some time ago.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.470
Seriously? I gotta hurry!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.960
<i>The Saints, huh?</i>

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.920
<i>They were the biggest idols in PriPara a while back.</i>

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.200
<i>They're so great.</i>

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.150
<i>I could never be like them, though.</i>

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.440
See you later!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.820
Stop trying to be like that other girl

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:54.850
You're better off just being yourself

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:00.270
Can't you feel it in your heart?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:06.070
Let's go look for our own ideals

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.570
And every single memory we make

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.060
We'll snap in two and

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.500
Complete the set with our friends

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:28.010
Make it! You're unbeatable once you get started

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:33.720
Make up! Headed for a gloriously shining future

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:39.580
Your dreams aren't out of reach

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:43.080
Anyone can make theirs come true

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.520
PriPara Pri-paradise

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.070
Good morning, Nao!

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:11.420
Morning, Lala.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.660
As loud as ever.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.700
Did you catch PriPara TV this morning?

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.060
You bet! The Saints special!

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:21.930
It was so lovely...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.090
And so sparkly...

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.490
PriPara really is...

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.650
A world all girls dream of!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:35.020
When the time comes, every girl finds a mysterious PriTicket that grants them entry to PriPara!

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.160
An invitation to a world of dreams!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.450
A place where aspiring idols and pros alike gather!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.610
Where they compete in shows of song, dance, and fashion sense!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.740
Competing!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.590
Truly a paradise for idols!

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:48.670
A paradise!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:52.020
You're just copying whatever I say, aren't you?

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.410
I'm no good with detailed explanations like that.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.870
Look! It's Houjou!

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.370
Houjou Sophie!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:58.970
So lovely!

00:03:58.970 --> 00:03:59.930
My heart skipped a beat!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.050
Look at that fan entourage.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.330
She looks like a model!

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:03.330
She's a professional!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:07.600
Houjou Sophie, a professional idol in second year of junior high.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.420
That's so cool. PriPara's full of amazing people like her, right?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:12.800
Hey, Lala!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.690
Oh wow! You got a PriTicket!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.810
I was so happy, I had to show it off to you!

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:24.130
I wish I got one too...

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.460
It'll come eventually.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.600
Yeah!

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.360
But...

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.130
Will you be all right?

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:36.240
We will now perform a PriTicket inspection.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.450
PriPara is strictly forbidden for our primary schoolers.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:42.720
And so, to prevent illicit PriPara activity,

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:48.790
I, your principal Ookanda Gloria, will see to the confiscation, the unerring confiscation of any and all PriTickets!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:53.560
PriPara's off limits for primary school students here, isn't it?

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.090
Is your PriTicket gonna be okay, Nao?

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.160
Don't worry!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:01.470
I made a secret pocket in the back of my collar and hid it there.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:05.900
As a primary school student, your first duty is studying. Your second is helping around the house.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:09.930
You have no time to waste on any of that gaudy idol nonsense!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:15.900
You all positively reek of PriTickets!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:18.260
Reek, I say.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.320
You there!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.760
Taste my custom-made vacuum!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.450
You have PriTickets, don't you?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.410
Don't try to hide them!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.500
You can't hide them from me.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.170
And you, and you, and you!

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.090
And you! And <i>you</i>!

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.550
Nao!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.970
This isn't enough.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.690
You! You have one at home, do you not?

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:53.150
I can <i>smell</i> it. You can't fool my nose. I better see it on my desk tomorrow.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.930
And that concludes our morning assembly.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.480
You holding up, Nao?

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:08.270
I only just got that PriTicket...

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:11.790
I can't believe PriPara's banned for primary school students.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:15.580
Apparently getting caught going there can get you a crazy punishment.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.580
Like what?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:17.760
According to the rumours...

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:19.430
They can burn you alive!

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:23.230
Or make you wear "idiot" on your face until you graduate!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.060
You're freaking me out!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:31.940
I wish I'd come to this school after I debuted like Houjou Sophie.

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:36.170
Debut? You really wanna be an idol?

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:39.430
Well yeah, who doesn't? Don't you?

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:45.070
Me? No way! I like PriPara, but I prefer to watch.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.990
That's enough for me.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.870
I left my recorder back in the classroom!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:51.420
I'll go get it!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.100
Hey!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.880
Go on and I'll catch up!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:58.260
<i>Gotta hurry – music class is about to start!</i>

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:00.720
You there, student. Halt!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.260
Head Disciplinarian Minami?

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:07.680
Manaka Lala, elementary school section. You again?

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:12.890
Rule 3243 of the Paprika Private Academy:

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.650
Do not run in the hallways.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.360
But we're outdoors, even if there is a roof.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.610
A hallway's a hallway!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.820
This is your 96th transgression!

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.580
I'm home...

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.370
School's so rough...

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:33.640
Welcome home!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.880
Welcome hominestrone!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.310
Welcome back, Lala!
Welcome hominestrone!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:36.920
Welcome back, Lala!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:37.890
Thanks.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.270
Could I get some focaccia?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.450
Capisce!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.440
One order of focaccia!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.220
On the double!
One order of focaccia!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.500
Got it.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:47.400
Hey, Mum, a PriTicket didn't arrive for me, did it?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.870
Not that I know of.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.100
Here's the focaccia.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.870
Bummer.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.020
Oh, one other thing!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.210
We're out of tomatoes; could you get some quick?

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.990
What? But I just got back!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.470
No buts.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.650
Everyone has to help out at home.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.780
Fine.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.200
Capisce.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.610
That's "Yes ma'am", young lady.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.620
See you later!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.400
Huh?

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.230
A PriTicket bag!

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:22.450
Who dropped this?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.140
So many tickets!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.640
Mirei, Idol in the Making.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.390
She's an idol!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:37.700
Does this belong to anyone here?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.020
Mirei the idol!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.990
Mirei, you dropped your bag!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:48.130
What now? I still need to go get those tomatoes.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:52.100
What if she's at PriPara right now?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.290
Maybe I'll go to PriPara...

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:56.910
for just a little peek...

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:04.470
Prism Stone... The entrance to PriPara...

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.290
Filled with wonderful clothes!
I'm not sure I'm even allowed in...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:13.200
Welcome to Prism Stone!

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:18.650
Uh, I'm looking for whoever dropped this.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.070
Oh?

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:25.550
Mirei entered PriPara from the gate here a while ago.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:26.750
I knew it.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.000
You came to bring this to her?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.110
Thank you! The gate's right this way.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.160
Wait!

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.400
Is something the matter?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:39.040
Uh, well, I actually haven't received a PriTicket yet...

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.190
It's my PriTicket!

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:51.970
How wonderful.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.650
But I'm not really allowed to...

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:59.950
Oh yeah, she said she was on the way to an important audition performance.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.150
And you can't use your items without your bag.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:08.180
<i>If she fails the audition because she lost this...</i>

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.850
Excuse me, but I'd like a closer look at the dress you have over there.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:14.100
I'll be with you in a moment.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.910
I'll go take this to her!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:19.120
Just a second.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.700
I think she'd appreciate that.

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:25.960
For you...

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.720
I'd recommend lovely style clothing.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.130
Wh–What?

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.920
Twinkle Ribbon seems like a good match.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.680
I'll mark that as your stage outfit brand.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.890
Since you're here, I think you should try to get a performance under your belt.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:41.510
Say what?

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:42.930
Right this way.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.880
Me? Performing?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.600
This is the gateway to PriPara.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.510
Just put your ticket in the scanner.

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:54.200
Okay.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.580
That will handle your registration to the world of PriPara.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.940
A fresh look that emphasises your loveliness with its striped ribbons,

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.720
the Cutie Ribbon Coord.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.330
PriPara Change complete!

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:26.860
Is this me?

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:30.140
This is really me?

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:33.070
I look totally different! Amazing!

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:35.710
My clothes are so stylish! And my hair!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:39.960
And I feel like I look way more mature!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.080
With the right makeup and clothes,

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:47.500
any girl can make a big transformation!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:53.010
Really? Wait, weren't you on the outside just now?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.140
We just look alike.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:57.180
Right...

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:58.830
Welcome to PriPara.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:02.150
Please enjoy the world of idols to the fullest.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:20.510
I'm really in PriPara!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:35.800
Wow! It's huge! And it's all part of PriPara!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.630
Oh no!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.310
Mirei!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.750
Mirei, are you here?

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.270
Mirei!

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.560
Are you kidding me-pri!?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.700
Not being able to perform for my audition is the worst-pri!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.870
Signing me up for a pair audition?

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.770
I can't believe you messed up so badly-pri!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.410
Now we have to find another performer-pri!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:04.690
There there. Just leave this to...

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:08.170
Me, the number one scout in all of PriPara Town-kuma!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:09.950
You're not number one at anything!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.480
You're a total loser!

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.890
And you're the one who messed up this time, too!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.440
I can't even participate without finding a pair-pri!

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.380
You imbearcile-pri!

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.680
Don't call me imbearcile-kuma!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:21.450
My name is Klaus Henrik Poncetta von Vogel–

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:21.880
Kuma!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.890
Yes?

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:27.520
Hurry up and find me a partner before I cancel our contract!

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:29.600
Got it-kuma! Quit it with the pri-pri nonsense-kuma!

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.230
<i>You</i> quit that kuma-kuma nonsense!

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.730
Loud and clear-kuma.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:39.830
Whatever, with my number one manager's gorgeous and mildly wild charm...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.740
Hey you, young lady over there? Howsabout a little performance?

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:46.330
Oh? You're too nervous to respond to someone so handsome?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.020
Oh, how about you, lovely young lady?

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.200
Or you, char–

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:49.960
Mirei!
Or you, char–

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:51.170
Mirei!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.940
Mirei, I have your bag!

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:55.380
What's your deal-kuma!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:57.810
Huh? A plushie?

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:01.800
I'm no plushie! I part of the cast! I'm a mascot! Mr. Kuma!

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.470
You making fun of me-kuma?

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:04.600
How dare you!

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:05.460
Sorry!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:11.070
This is my first time in PriPara, so I don't really have any idea what's what or where I am.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.510
What are you doing-pri?

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:13.360
Kuma?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.480
You're Mirei!

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.430
Yeah, that's me-pri.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:21.570
That's great.

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:23.540
Here. Your PriTicket bag.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:26.320
I found this on the ground and came to bring it to you.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.620
Capisce!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:32.500
Wow, so there it was! I was in a pinch-pri! Thank you-pri!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:36.800
You came all this way to bring it-pri? That's ultra nice of you-pri!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.640
I'm glad I found you!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.920
I'll be on my way now.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:46.620
But even though I got it back,
I can't use it for my performance-pri.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:47.460
Oh?

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:55.010
That imbearcile over there booked me for a pair audition, so I can't perform on my own-pri.

00:14:55.850 --> 00:15:00.740
You're so nice; would you pair up with me for the audition, pri-please?

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:01.700
What?

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.700
No way, no way!

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:04.940
I just came to bring your bag–

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:05.990
Pri-please!
I just came to bring your bag–

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:10.870
I've been training so hard for this audition – day in, day out!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.000
Pri-please help me out! I'm begging you-pri!

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:17.690
But I've never sung on stage!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:18.590
I've never danced either.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.090
But do you like PriPara?

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.270
I love it!

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:25.220
Then you'll be fine! I'm pri-sure you can do it!

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:30.490
Pri-please? Please? Please? <i>Ple-ease</i>?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.710
Capisce!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.100
All right!

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.060
No, my hand just...

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.360
Thanks a lot-pri!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:40.540
I'm Mirei. "A pop and a step and I've gotcha!"

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.320
That Mirei. You know.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.030
I'm Lala.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:48.340
I'm not sure I follow, but I guess things worked out-kuma.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.040
All thanks to me-kuma!

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:55.520
<i>The registration for Fresh Idol Live is closing shortly.</i>

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.500
<i>The registration for Fresh Idol Live is closing shortly.</i>

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.610
I've got entrants for you! Lala and Mirei-kuma!
<i>The registration for Fresh Idol Live is closing shortly.</i>

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:01.430
I've got entrants for you! Lala and Mirei-kuma!

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.930
Don't forget my team-kuma!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:08.730
Entry number 6, team name: Pretty App.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.340
Ready, go!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.110
They're good.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:21.320
And I'm up after them? I said I'd do it, but how am I gonna...

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.380
I can't do this.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:26.390
No way can I sing in front of all these people!

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.790
Lala, do you know the Saints' songs-pri?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.730
Y-Yeah!

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.600
Then there's no problem-pri!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.250
Sing some!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:40.810
Stop trying to be like that ot–

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.450
You're so quiet!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.790
You were pri-loud up until now too!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.720
B-But...

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:55.400
<i>People always say I'm too loud, so I try to be quiet when it comes to singing and stuff.</i>

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.980
That loosen ya up-pri?

00:16:58.980 --> 00:16:59.840
Whuh?

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.800
Everyone's waiting for us idols to sing!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:06.910
We've gotta sing with all we've got to reach the whole world!

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:11.620
This is the place where any girl can do that!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.870
Allowed to... sing with all you've got.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:18.090
Entry number 7: Lala and Mirei.

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:19.330
Ready, go!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.550
The stage is through here-pri!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:37.430
<i>I can do this! I can do this!</i>

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:40.620
<i>So everyone can hear!</i>

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:03.670
<i>With all I've got!</i>

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.090
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:18.100
I'll get to keep my job-kuma.

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:30.670
Th-This voice is...

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.200
Could it be the legendary...

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.950
Prism Voice.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.910
<i>I can't lose to her!</i>

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.690
Making Drama! Switch on!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:48.510
Aim for the top in dance!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.140
On the runway!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.430
And in singing!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.440
Let's go! PriPara!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.530
Cyalume Change!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.430
Good job-kuma!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.480
You did great!

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.350
Here's your PriTicket.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:48.010
Today's performance is recorded on there.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.190
It is?

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.630
Lala, snap off this bit from yours-pri.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.250
Huh?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.490
These are Friend Tickets-pri.

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.800
You trade these with friends.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.460
Let's perform together again!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.930
Performing with you today was pri-great!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:14.960
Friend Tickets...

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:16.530
And you'll get these too-kuma.

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:20.340
Your PriTicket bag and PriPass.

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:22.850
You can use this to contact others in PriPara.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.560
Really? This is awesome!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.040
Forbidden

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.340
Okay, see you later, I need to hurry!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.360
She's a restless one.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:39.960
The "get in the wrong audition and drop my bag on purpose" plan worked perfectpri!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:47.820
I figured anyone who would actually bring it all the way here wouldn't say no to joining me for the audition.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.340
My calculations were perfect.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:51.550
Wha – you did all that on purpose-kuma?

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.010
Of course.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.980
But that girl went beyond my expectations.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:21:00.630
Her singing and my fashion sense can be synergised for approximately 4.85 our individual strengths.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:02.560
My winning formula is coming together.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.180
As devious as ever, Mirei!

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.930
But you're slipping out of character.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.310
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.280
Mirei's such a kidder-pri!

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:14.190
Either way, we hit the jackpot with that girl.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.390
Once I make a top idol of her,

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.250
I'll be known as the number one scout-kuma!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.240
Still...

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:28.400
The legendary Prism Voice...
There's no doubt about it-kuma.

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:31.430
I broke the tomatoes – no, the rules!

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:35.130
I'm in trouble now!

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.530
PriPara was a lot of fun!

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:13.120
But if the headmistress finds out, I'll be in for some crazy punishment!

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:14.660
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:17.470
That performance with Lala was the best-pri!

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.500
Sorry, Mirei, but I can't go to PriPara anymore!

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:25.220
What? Why? You promised you would-pri! Hold on-pri!

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:27.470
What should I do?

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:29.990
Next time: Breaking promises is pri-bad!

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:32.190
I'm counting on you, Lala.

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.090
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
